---
---

<section
  id="reality"
  class="w-full px-6 sm:px-12 max-w-7xl mx-auto py-24 sm:py-32 border-t border-[#2C241D]/10"
>
  <!-- Tarjeta Editorial de Gran Formato con Fondo de Textura de Pino -->
  <div class="relative rounded-sm overflow-hidden bg-white border border-[#2C241D]/12 shadow-[0_16px_48px_rgba(44,36,29,0.06)]">
    <!-- Imagen de textura de acuarela botánica de pino en el fondo -->
    <div class="absolute inset-0 pointer-events-none select-none overflow-hidden opacity-10 mix-blend-multiply">
      <img
        src="/assets/pine_branches_texture.jpg"
        alt="Botanical Pine Branches Watercolor Texture"
        class="w-full h-full object-cover object-right-top"
      />
    </div>

    <!-- Contenido Editorial Espacioso y Bien Jerarquizado -->
    <div class="relative z-10 p-8 sm:p-14 lg:p-16 space-y-12">
      <!-- Encabezado con Metadatos Finos -->
      <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-[#2C241D]/10 pb-5">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest text-[#2C241D]/50 uppercase">
            REALITY CHECK // TECHNICAL HONESTY
          </span>
          <span class="w-1.5 h-1.5 rounded-full bg-[#2D6A4F]"></span>
          <span class="text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest text-[#2D6A4F] uppercase font-semibold">
            PINUS SYLVESTRIS
          </span>
        </div>
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#2D6A4F] select-none font-bold">
          EST. 2024
        </span>
      </div>

      <!-- Título Editorial a Gran Escala -->
      <div class="max-w-3xl space-y-4">
        <span class="text-xs font-mono text-[#E59728] uppercase tracking-widest block">
          A Grounded Philosophy
        </span>
        <h2 class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-7xl font-serif-editorial font-light tracking-tight text-[#2C241D] leading-[1.02]">
          Growing slowly, <br />
          <em class="italic font-normal text-[#2D6A4F]">
            as a pine tree does.
          </em>
        </h2>
      </div>

      <!-- Cuerpo del Ensayo a Doble Columna Espaciosa -->
      <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 gap-8 lg:gap-14 pt-4 border-t border-[#2C241D]/10">
        <!-- Columna 1: Smoke & Mirrors vs Respeto a los Gigantes -->
        <div class="md:col-span-6 space-y-4 text-[#2C241D]/80 leading-relaxed font-light text-base sm:text-lg">
          <p class="font-serif-editorial italic text-xl sm:text-2xl text-[#2C241D] leading-snug">
            “No smoke and mirrors. We have no desire to slay giants.”
          </p>
          <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-[#2C241D]/70 font-sans leading-relaxed">
            It is neither viable nor sensible to claim we will replace decades
            of engineering in C, Rust, Go, or Python. We recognize and deeply
            respect the enduring permanence of the foundational tools that built
            our industry.
          </p>
        </div>

        <!-- Columna 2: La Alternativa de Nicho con Alma -->
        <div class="md:col-span-6 space-y-4 text-sm sm:text-base text-[#2C241D]/75 font-sans leading-relaxed font-light flex flex-col justify-between">
          <p>
            Pino stands serenely as a transparent, efficient niche alternative
            that embraces patient evolution. A welcoming haven for developers
            and students who seek the ergonomic beauty of code without drowning
            in setup bureaucracy or draining hardware memory.
          </p>
          <p class="text-xs font-mono text-[#2C241D]/60 uppercase tracking-wider pt-2 border-t border-[#2C241D]/8">
            Measured engineering over artificial hype. Rooted in real human
            needs.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Barra Inferior de Compromiso -->
      <div class="pt-6 border-t border-[#2C241D]/10 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 text-[10px] font-mono tracking-widest text-[#2C241D]/50 uppercase">
        <span>A TOOL TAILORED FOR HUMANS</span>
        <span class="text-[#2C241D]/80 font-semibold">
          WITH EYES KEPT FIRMLY ON THE HORIZON
        </span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
